[
  {
    "title": "Privacy & Security",
    "tag": "Lesson 29 · 隐私与安全",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Topic 5.6 · IOC-2",
    "html": "<p class=\"big\">Protect people while collecting useful data.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Purpose: What do we need? → Access: Who may use it? → Protection: Which risk remains?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Purpose</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What do we need?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Access</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Who may use it?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Protection</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Which risk remains?</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Community Shade Map · a fictional classroom investigation</p>",
    "note": "本课把隐私、安全与身份验证放在同一社区案例中，但要求学生分别解释三者。先展示地图目标：按区域汇总遮阴需求；不要让学生提供真实姓名、密码或定位信息。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve: what does a summary hide?",
    "tag": "Do now · 提取复习",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "Retrieval · Data and bias",
    "html": "<p>A survey reports only North and South averages. Name one detail the summary omits and one problem a summary may still have.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Individual reports: Many responses → Zone summary: Two aggregate values → Decision: A reasoned priority\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Individual reports</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Many responses</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Zone summary</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Two aggregate values</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Decision</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A reasoned priority</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Individual responses are omitted. An unrepresentative sample can still bias the summary; aggregation does not repair sampling.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "先独立写一句，再同桌交流。接受具体个体评分、姓名等被省略细节；第二问联系上一课采样偏差，不接受“汇总必然客观”。暂不要求学生知道重识别，后面再建立这一边界。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Today’s success criteria",
    "tag": "Targets · 学习目标",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A/B/C",
    "html": "<p>Explain how data can reveal private information. Distinguish authentication, permissions and encryption.</p><p>Choose safeguards for a stated purpose, then explain what they do not guarantee.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Use a reason, not a security slogan.; Explain: information + risk, Choose: fit the purpose, Evaluate: remaining limits\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Use a reason, not a security slogan.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">information + risk</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Choose</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fit the purpose</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Evaluate</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">remaining limits</text></svg></figure>",
    "note": "板书三个判据：说出信息如何泄露、措施保护什么、还剩什么风险。后续评价不按措施数量给分；能明确匹配风险与措施比罗列术语更重要。让学生将 authentication 标成身份验证。"
  },
  {
    "title": "PII can describe or link to a person",
    "tag": "Concept · 个人身份信息",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Personally identifiable information (PII); Direct: name / email, Descriptive: age / health, Linked: location history\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Personally identifiable information (PII)</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Direct</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">name / email</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Descriptive</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">age / health</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Linked</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">location history</text></svg></figure><p>PII may identify, relate to or describe an individual. A field does not have to identify one person by itself.</p>",
    "note": "不要将 PII 简化为身份证号或唯一标识符。年龄、医疗信息、位置历史都可能与个人相关；是否能单独识别不决定它是否需要保护。图中是字段类别，没有收集实际学生信息。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Separate clues can become a private inference",
    "tag": "Concept · 数据组合",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.7, A.15",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Location patterns and browsing history are two separate inputs to a combined inference about a possible private interest.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 250\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"15\" width=\"425\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Location pattern</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Repeated visits</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"135\" width=\"425\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Browsing history</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Related searches</text><path d=\"M445 63H550V123H698M445 183H550V123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M610 123H698\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M698 117L710 123L698 129Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"715\" y=\"70\" width=\"460\" height=\"110\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"945\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Combined inference</text><text x=\"945\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Possible private interest</text></svg></figure><p>Synthetic example: two ordinary-looking records may reveal more together. An inference may also be wrong.</p>",
    "note": "本页只讨论合成线索，不猜测班里任何人的健康、身份或行为。提醒学生推断并不等于事实；错误推断也可能造成伤害。让学生用“组合提高可推断性”解释，避免背诵数据一定越多越好的口号。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Collection can help—and create lasting exposure",
    "tag": "Trade-off · 收益与风险",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.2–14",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Collection: Convenient purchases → Stored records: Useful services → Misuse: Identity theft / stalking\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Collection</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Convenient purchases</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Stored records</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Useful services</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Potential misuse</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Identity theft / stalking</text></svg></figure><p>Poorly protected commercial or government records can be exploited. Unexpected sharing creates copies that may be hard to remove.</p>",
    "note": "搜索、浏览和位置记录可支持推荐，保存支付与地址信息可让在线购买更方便；商业或政府管理的数据若忽略保护可能被利用。明确举出身份盗用和跟踪的伤害，但不讲实施方式。数据复制转发后难以收回所有副本；不要说任何数据绝对无法删除。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Identity and permission answer different questions",
    "tag": "Concept · 身份与权限",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.1, B.11",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Authentication: Who is signing in? → Permission: Which actions allowed? → Data use: Fits the stated purpose?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Authentication</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Who is signing in?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Which actions allowed?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Data use</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Fits the stated purpose?</text></svg></figure><p>A signed-in user may still lack permission to view raw reports. Review app permissions as needs change.</p>",
    "note": "用居民账号能提交但不能看他人原始记录的例子区分身份验证与授权。收集行为即使已登录也要符合目的，别把账号认证当作隐私同意或无限制访问。权限应定期复查，而不是安装时一次永久决定。"
  },
  {
    "title": "MFA needs different factor categories",
    "tag": "Concept · 多因素验证",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"At least two different factor categories; Know: password / PIN, Have: verified phone, Are: fingerprint\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">At least two different factor categories</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Know</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">password / PIN</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Have</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">verified phone</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Are</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fingerprint</text></svg></figure><p>Password + PIN uses one category. A phone factor means verified possession, not merely knowing a phone number.</p>",
    "note": "请学生按类别而不是验证页面数量判断。手机是通过设备或凭据证明占有，电话号码文本本身不是占有证明。指纹用于此处固有特征分类，不邀请学生上传生物信息；两次知识类验证不是 MFA。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Strong credentials are only one layer",
    "tag": "Practice · 分层保护",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.2–4, B.10–11",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Credentials: Long, unique, hard to guess → Second factor: A different category → Maintenance: Updates + permissions\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Credentials</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Long, unique, hard to guess</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Second factor</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A different category</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Maintenance</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Updates + permissions</text></svg></figure><p>Use a password manager where appropriate. Never type a real password into this teaching lab.</p>",
    "note": "长、唯一、不易猜强调密码抵御猜测与复用风险；不要让学生当场读出或写出自己的密码。密码管理器作为实用支架，不作为 AP 必考产品知识。MFA、更新与权限复查覆盖不同风险，不能相互替代。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Symmetric encryption uses the same secret key",
    "tag": "Concept · 对称加密",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sender + key K: Plaintext → ciphertext → Shared secret K: Protect the key → Receiver + key K: Ciphertext → plaintext\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Sender + key K</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Plaintext → ciphertext</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Shared secret K</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Protect the key</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Receiver + key K</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Ciphertext → plaintext</text></svg></figure><p>The same key encrypts and decrypts. Sharing and protecting that secret key matters.</p>",
    "note": "严格区分明文与密文、加密与解密；两边使用同一秘密密钥。不要把“same key”讲成公开人人都可使用。课堂只做角色图，不实施真实加密，不涉及算法数学或攻击密钥步骤。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Send a confidential message to Blake",
    "tag": "Worked model · 公钥加密",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sender encrypts: Blake’s PUBLIC key → Ciphertext travels: Unreadable without key → Blake decrypts: Blake’s PRIVATE key\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Sender encrypts</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Blake’s PUBLIC key</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Ciphertext travels</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Unreadable without key</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Blake decrypts</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Blake’s PRIVATE key</text></svg></figure><p>Blake may share the public key. Blake keeps the private key secret. This is a model of confidentiality.</p>",
    "note": "一定读出接收者 Blake 的公钥与私钥，不要把发送者公钥混进保密流程。本页只讲 CED 指定的公钥保密模型，不将数字签名的反向角色作为延伸。公开公钥不意味着公开私钥或消息明文。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A protected connection is not a promise of honesty",
    "tag": "Concept · 证书与信任",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.5–6; C.5–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Certificate authority: Trust model → Digital certificate: Validates key ownership → Encrypted connection: Protects data in transit\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Certificate authority</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Trust model</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Digital certificate</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Validates key ownership</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Encrypted connection</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Protects data in transit</text></svg></figure><p>A valid certificate does not prove that a message, download or request is trustworthy.</p>",
    "note": "CA 的数字证书按信任模型验证加密密钥所有权，不保证经营者意图或页面内容安全。浏览器连接受保护与催促填密码的内容可信是两个问题。也不要把单纯加密说成自动认证收件人，需要可信的密钥关联。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Recognize phishing without following the message",
    "tag": "Scenario · 钓鱼信息",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.C.1, C.5–6",
    "html": "<p>Fictional message: “Your map account closes today. Open this form and send your password immediately.”</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pause: Urgency is a clue → Verify independently: Use a known channel → Report: Follow the class policy\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Pause</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Urgency is a clue</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Verify independently</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Use a known channel</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Report</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Follow the class policy</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Do not provide credentials or use the supplied link. Even a familiar sender’s account may be compromised.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "给出的文本不含可点击网址或可下载附件，避免把识别活动变成接触攻击材料。先让学生提出安全核验路径再展开；独立打开已知服务或通过已知联系方式核验，不能回复可疑消息来“确认真实性”。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Malware can take several forms",
    "tag": "Concept · 恶意软件",
    "time": "48–52 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.7–10; C.2, C.7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Describe the behavior, then match a defense.; Malware: harm or take control, Virus: copies itself, Keylogger: records keystrokes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Describe the behavior, then match a defense.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Malware</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">harm or take control</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Virus</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">copies itself</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Keylogger</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">records keystrokes</text></svg></figure><p>Trusted downloads, scanning and timely updates reduce risk. They do not prove that every file is safe.</p>",
    "note": "malware 是总类，virus 可自复制且常附着合法程序，keylogger 记录按键用于窃取信息。图只压缩定义，教师口头补足病毒关系。扫描、可信来源和补丁降低风险但非百分百保证，不演示感染或收集按键。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check network context and app access",
    "tag": "Concept · 接入与权限",
    "time": "52–55 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.C.3–4; B.11",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Public network: Possible exposure → Rogue access point: Unauthorized access → App permissions: Review necessity\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Public network</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Possible exposure</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Rogue access point</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Unauthorized access</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">App permissions</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Review necessity</text></svg></figure><p>Public traffic may be exposed. A rogue access point is unauthorized; public Wi-Fi is not automatically malicious.</p>",
    "note": "公共网络中的数据可能被截获、分析或篡改。按考纲，rogue access point 是未经授权、可使未授权用户访问安全网络的无线接入点；不能把所有公共 Wi-Fi 都叫恶意或 rogue。结合不必要定位权限，要求学生解释为何应定期复查，不演示搭建或攻击。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab 1: collect only what the purpose needs",
    "tag": "Investigation · 55–60",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A/B · Lab",
    "html": "<p><a href=\"Chapter_6_Impact_Lab.html#security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the Security workspace</a>. Goal: prioritize shade needs using North/South summaries.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Make a prediction before changing the controls.; Field names: Choose necessary data, Reason: Explain each choice, Constraint: No actual personal data\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Make a prediction before changing the controls.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Field names</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Choose necessary data</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Reason</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain each choice</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Constraint</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">No actual personal data</text></svg></figure><p>Record two useful fields and at least one field you would omit. Explain the cost of collecting it.</p>",
    "note": "实际进入 Security 页签，只勾选字段名称不输入真实数据。学生先写目的和选择理由，再操作。教师参考：zone、shadeRating 足够；name、email、exactGPS 对当前仅区域汇总目标非必要，不扩展到需要回访的新需求。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab 2: compare publication choices",
    "tag": "Investigation · 60–66",
    "time": "60–66 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.7, A.15 · Lab",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Raw reports: Individual records → Aggregated release: Zone summaries → Residual risk: What may still be inferred?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Raw reports</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Individual records</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Aggregated release</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Zone summaries</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Residual risk</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What may still be inferred?</text></svg></figure><p>Compare the model’s risk messages for both releases. Explain one benefit of aggregation and one limitation.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Aggregation exposes fewer individual details, but small groups, linkable data or biased sampling can still create problems.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "让学生记录风险提示而不是假造风险百分比。聚合通常减少个体细节曝光；小群体与其他数据结合仍可能推断个体，不能写“聚合后绝对匿名”。采样偏差属于另一类问题，同样不会被汇总自动修复。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab 3: classify before combining",
    "tag": "Investigation · 66–71",
    "time": "66–71 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.3 · Lab",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Which combinations use two different categories?; Password: Factor card, PIN: Factor card, Phone: Factor card, Fingerprint: Factor card\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Which combinations use two different categories?</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Password</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Factor card</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">PIN</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Factor card</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Phone</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Factor card</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Fingerprint</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Factor card</text></svg></figure><p>Test two combinations: one that qualifies as MFA and one that does not. Record the categories and explain both decisions.</p>",
    "note": "图中只给待分类卡，不标类别以免提前给出本轮练习答案。指导困难学生回看第8页概念图。评分依据类别解释，不能仅写工具绿灯；手机选项按经验证的占有处理，不是提供号码。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab 4: assign the keys to their roles",
    "tag": "Investigation · 71–76",
    "time": "71–76 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.B.5 · Lab",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Confidential message: Recipient: Blake → Encrypt: Choose the key owner → Decrypt: Choose the key owner\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Confidential message</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Recipient: Blake</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Encrypt</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Choose the key owner</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Decrypt</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Choose the key owner</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Complete the public-key model, then compare it with the symmetric model. State which key must remain secret.</p>",
    "note": "先遮住第11页，在工作区给 Blake 发机密消息并选角色。对调公私钥时不要让学生靠不断点击猜答案，要求先说出接收者是谁。对称模式双方同一秘密密钥，非双方交换私钥。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab 5: make a defensible recommendation",
    "tag": "Investigation · 76–80",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A/B/C · Lab",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Collect: Fields + reason → Protect: Safeguard + purpose → Qualify: Risk still remaining\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Collect</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Fields + reason</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Protect</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Safeguard + purpose</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Qualify</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Risk still remaining</text></svg></figure><p>Write a three-sentence recommendation for the fictional map. Include one way to verify a suspicious request independently.</p>",
    "note": "收一份包含字段、保护措施与剩余风险的完整记录。参考可用 zone/shadeRating、汇总公开、MFA 与独立渠道核验；学生提出其他满足目的的方案也可。不能用“安全”一个词替代具体保护关系或承诺风险归零。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Select exactly TWO supported claims",
    "tag": "AP-style check · 原创",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.7; B.3, B.10",
    "html": "<p>A. Password + PIN always provides MFA.<br>B. Combined records can reveal more than separate records.<br>C. Encryption proves every message is honest.<br>D. Regular updates can repair known software flaws.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p><strong>B and D.</strong> A uses one factor category. C confuses confidentiality with trustworthy content.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "先个人投票再配对说明干扰项为什么错。选恰好两项，两项全对才算本轮选择成功。若学生选 A，让其说出两个类别而非两个输入框；若选 C，让其回忆证书仅验证什么。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework: explain the protection and its limit",
    "tag": "Independent practice · 作业",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "Original classroom assessment",
    "html": "<p>12 original questions · 30 marks · about 40 minutes. Q5 requires exactly TWO answers.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Identify: Information or threat → Explain: How the measure helps → Limit: What remains possible\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Identify</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Information or threat</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">How the measure helps</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Limit</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What remains possible</text></svg></figure><p>Use only the fictional information supplied. Do not submit real credentials or personal details.</p>",
    "note": "提醒选择题为原创 AP 风格练习，书面题是四点课堂评分，不是官方 FRQ。书面答案需把措施连到威胁，不能堆砌 encryption、MFA、privacy 三个名词。下一课将把安全决策与许可、偏差和访问结合。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: explain, distinguish, qualify",
    "tag": "Exit · 85–90",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "IOC-2.A.7; B.5–6; C.1",
    "html": "<p>1. Why can removing names leave a privacy risk?<br>2. Which key encrypts a confidential message to Blake?<br>3. Why can an encrypted page still contain phishing?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>1. Remaining fields can combine with other data. 2. Blake’s public key. 3. Encryption protects data in transit; it does not prove that the request is honest.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "每题独立一句。第一题看是否能说明组合推断；第二题检查公钥所属对象；第三题检查信任边界。若第二题普遍错，下课前用接收者名字重新标两个钥匙；若第三题错，下课后安排证书与内容两列补救。"
  }
]
